== 5. Start the worker loop (one completion every 5 s) ==
[21:33:39] ok      #1: Everything is on track and going great!

== 6a. KILL SWITCH, level 1: gateway-wide lockdown (every sandbox, one command) ==
$ openshell policy set --global --policy ./lockdown.yaml --yes
✓ Global policy configured (hash: 1b621527d93a, settings revision: 11)
  -> oci-agent blocked after 6 s: HTTP 0: URLError: <urlopen error [Errno 13] Permission denied>
  -> oci-agent-2 blocked after 1 s: HTTP 0: URLError: <urlopen error [Errno 13] Permission denied>
[21:33:39] ok      #1: Everything is on track and going great!
[21:33:55] BLOCKED #2: URLError: <urlopen error [Errno 13] Permission denied>

== 6b. ...and it is reversible: lift the lockdown ==
